<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 11.98pct from 12.12pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 11.98pct from 12.12pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month eased to 11.98 from 12.12 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) slipped to 11.44 from 11.55 percent.</p>
<p>ATHIBOR</p>
